-- zz_derived_tier_mods.sql  —  SNAPSHOT, do not hand-edit row-by-row
--
-- Captures item_mods that existed ONLY in the live database and were in no
-- committed SQL file. Source: modules/custom/sql/fix_missing_gear_mods.sql
-- (derives +1/+2/+4 from the next-lower tier x1.10) plus manual balance
-- passes on accessories. Those rows are at risk because dbtool sorts
-- modules/custom/sql/* BEFORE sql/item_mods.sql, whose DROP TABLE wipes them
-- on a full import — so without this file, a rebuild nakes ~468 items.
--
-- This is a SNAPSHOT of current live values. zz_ prefix => loads after
-- item_mods.sql; INSERT IGNORE => never overrides an authoritative row.
--
-- To refresh after changing tier stats: re-apply fix_missing_gear_mods.sql
-- to the DB, then regenerate this file (see tools/_at_risk_dbonly_mods.json).
-- Captured: 468 items.
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

